 281:                         the dedicated jobs, the Opus measuring seat and the flagship; the state_note; the closure;
 282:                         the filed rows.  REFUSES if the row already cites panel_20260926_021621.
 283:   opus <grade> <ev>     the Opus seat's ACCEPTS-46 enumeration (after it lands).
 284:   astra <verdict> <ev>  GPT-6 Astra's confirmation of the F2 ruling and the final text.
 285:   sha <sha>             crimewidthkill.commits (and scorehyphenfp's, whose fix ships in the same commit).
 286:   setcommits <row> <sha>  another row's commits (the previous round's pending record).
 287: CRLF on disk, json.dumps(indent=1, ensure_ascii=False), no trailing newline -- round-trip verified before any write.
 288: """
